  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n* fix: show top-level log record EventName in logs view by @tridev-tej in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/498\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* fix(tui): show span-level dropped counts in the span detail by @momolly1024 in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/500\r\n* fix(tui): show unset metric fields as not set and stop the summary panic by @Detoy in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/499\r\n\r\n### Others\r\n\r\n* [Automated] Update Nix Flake by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/484\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 13 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/485\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/487\r\n* chore: remove redundant depandabot config for tuiexporter by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/488\r\n* chore: remove legacy lint tool dependencies by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/489\r\n* ci: split Go build cache keys per job by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/490\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/491\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/sys from 0.48.0 to 0.49.0 in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/492\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/493\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 20 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/494\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/501\r\n* ci: cap golangci-lint memory and keep the main lint cache alive by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/503\r\n* docs: add CONTRIBUTING.md with issue claim and assignment flow by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/504\r\n* [Automated] Update otel-tui/tuiexporter version by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/505\r\n* ci: extend goreleaser timeout to 60m in the release workflow by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/508\r\n* ci: build release binaries one at a time by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/511\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @tridev-tej made their first contribution in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/498\r\n* @momolly1024 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/500\r\n* @Detoy made their first contribution in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/499\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/compare/v0.7.5...v0.7.6",
  "mentions_count": 5
}
